        <mxCell id="code1" value="&lt;font face=&quot;monospace&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;__init__: apply_numa_affinity(gpu_indices) → sched_setaffinity + numa_set_preferred&lt;br&gt;to_cache: set_memory_policy_preferred(node_id) → .cpu() allocates on local DRAM&lt;br&gt;from_cache: apply_numa_affinity(new_gpus) → re-pin for potentially different GPUs&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
